WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,580
Lin Bianyu, do you dare to hit Yunbao?

2
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,900
If you go in, dare to fight

3
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:12,440
If you want to file a complaint, go ahead.

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,440
Check my daughter

5
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,560
Why don't you dare to tell mom?

6
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,920
I regret playing late

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,540
No matter how dark the mouse is

8
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,930
What kind of woman is she who doesn’t know whether to live or die?

9
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:24,750
Dare to bully our kid brother?

10
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,670
I'm going to find that woman and beat her up.

11
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,630
Dare to bully Rainbow Dash

12
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,670
I make her look good

13
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:31,270
You can't finish the report before getting off work

14
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,550
It looks better when you get scolded

15
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:36,230
Then you still let me pick up Rainbow Dash?

16
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,350
Otherwise, I will be scolded

17
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,940
Seriously

18
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,340
That woman is Lin Bianyu

19
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,420
Not a good thing

20
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,940
It turned out to be Lin Bianyu

21
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,540
Just find someone to beat him up

22
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,420
Don't do things that are not worthy of publicity

23
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:56,840
Brother, if you really want to beat someone up, please tell me later.

24
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:02,940
Rainbow Dash, don't dig through the trash can

25
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,620
Baby look at me
